% Repo-authored validation corpus program.
% A square with an inner square, filled with the even-odd rule so the
% inner square becomes a hole.
0 setgray
newpath
50 50 moveto
200 0 rlineto
0 200 rlineto
-200 0 rlineto
closepath
100 100 moveto
100 0 rlineto
0 100 rlineto
-100 0 rlineto
closepath
eofill
showpage
